             * CRNRSTN :: ISO_80000 (Binary)
             * -----
             * Value        IEC             Memory
             * 1024         KiB kibibyte    KB  kilobyte
             * 1024^2       MiB mebibyte    MB  megabyte
             * 1024^3       GiB gibibyte    GB  gigabyte
             * 1024^4       TiB tebibyte    TB  terabyte
             * 1024^5       PiB pebibyte        –
